---
description: Rules for the http package
globs: packages/http/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `packages/http/AGENTS.md` and `packages/http/docs/en/ARCHITECTURE.md` first.
- Parser order in `Bootstrap` is the priority order; adding a parser follows the steps in `packages/http/AGENTS.md`.
- Unit tests call parsers on a real `Response` without `fetch`; integration tests use a local `node:http` server.
